      ],
      "text": "OD:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " resp depression, somnolence progressing to stupor or coma, constricted pupils, brady, hypotension; give naloxone or nalmefene and monitor until spont breathing = reliably back, b/c reversal = shorter than morphine's action."
